Fixes:
- Write colours with transparency through color-mix instead of appending a hex alpha, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours keep their tints.
- The window was 940 wide and lines did not wrap, so a line over about 68 characters was cut off, and pasted Windows line endings left a stray character on every line; the window grows to the longest line and shrinks to fit the frame, and lines split on either ending.

